# Naive playtest save files and stray driver output: transient game state that
# Scaffolding playtesters build for themselves: named pipes, forwarder logs and
# Throwaway tutorial verification runs (created by test agents); not deliverables
# helper scripts. A fifo in particular must never be committed. The notes and
# rewrites after every command. The testers' NOTES (.md) are the deliverable.
# the session saves are the deliverables; this is the rig they were made with.
*.pyc
.selftest*/
__pycache__/
rome/playtest/naive/*.fifo
rome/playtest/naive/*.json
rome/playtest/naive/*.log
rome/playtest/naive/*.out
rome/playtest/naive/game.in
rome/playtest/naive/game.out
rome/playtest/naive/send.sh
rome/playtest/scratchpad/
tutorial-runs/
